-based competitions organised by Wipro Technologies, earning Gold Certificates in both Big Data and AI/ML — a recognition of my passion for project-based, applied learning."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"I am an active member of both IEEE and ACM, and serve as a peer reviewer for journals including Knowledge-Based Systems, Expert Systems with Applications, IEEE Access, and Neural Computing & Applications."}]]}],"$L8"]}]}]}],"$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le"]}],["$Lf","$L10"],"$L11"]}],{},null,false,false]},null,false,false],"$L12",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$13",[]],"S":true}
